 Elemental Mastery and bonus ATK or EM after reactions. A usable Aggravate alternative, though Golden Troupe is usually stronger.","stats":"EM/ATK% · Electro · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Outta Control","members":["Fischl","Clorinde","Mavuika","Chevreuse"],"text":"Clorinde drives the damage while Fischl and Mavuika trigger Overload. Chevreuse buffs the team and shreds enemy resistance.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Battery","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Boom & Hex","members":["Fischl","Klee","Emilie","Bennett"],"text":"Klee drives on-field damage, Fischl triggers Overload, Emilie boosts Burning damage, and Bennett provides healing and ATK buffs.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Battery","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Electrolyte Overload","members":["Fischl","Cyno","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Cyno drives Aggravate while Fischl adds off field Electro damage. Nahida supports Quicken, and Baizhu heals. Cyno’s long rotations can limit Oz uptime.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Battery","On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Raiden at Home","members":["Fischl","Xingqiu","Beidou","Sucrose"],"text":"Fischl and Beidou deal off-field Electro damage, Xingqiu enables Electro-Charged, and Sucrose drives reactions with Swirl.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS","On-field Driver"]}],"v":"Off-field Oz: Golden Troupe excels for off-field Skill damage. In Aggravate, balance EM with ATK and CRIT.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["On & Off-field"],"about":"Fischl is an off-field Electro DPS who uses Oz for consistent damage and powerful reactions. She excels in reaction-focused teams and provides strong damage with minimal field time.","pros":["Strong Off-Field Damage","Fast Electro Application","Strong Battery"],"cons":["Limited AoE","Oz Positioning","Skill Downtime","Burst Reliant Rotation"],"weapons":["Polar Star","Aqua Simulacra","Skyward Harp","Thundering 